# API

- Prisma models camelCase; columns snake_case via `@map`. Tables plural snake (`@@map`).
- `/api/admin/*` mutates curriculum; student routes read + write sessions/attempts only.
- No `admin_users` table. Check `ADMIN_USERNAME` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD`.
- Follow `docs/DATA.md`.
